---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../components/shared/Paragraph.astro";
import Titlenew from "../components/shared/Titlenew.astro";
import {
  Cloud,
  ShieldCheck,
  Users,
  KeyRound,
  BarChart3,
  Terminal,
  ServerCog,
  BadgeCheck,
  Activity,
} from "lucide-astro";
import Selar from "../components/sections/Selar.astro";
import Requirement from "../components/sections/Requirement.astro";
import Pagebreadcrumb from "../components/shared/Pagebreadcrumb.astro";
---

<Layout title="CloudTweak - M365 Bootcamp - Week 1">
  <main class="flex flex-col gap-y-16 md:gap-y-24 overflow-hidden">
    <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background Effects -->
      <div
        class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[25rem] w-[25rem] rounded-full bg-green-500/10 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>

      <Container className="relative z-10">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
          <span
            class="inline-flex
          items-center
          gap-2
          rounded-full
          border
          border-cyan-500/20
          bg-cyan-500/10
          px-5
          py-2
          text-sm
          font-medium
          text-cyan-700
          dark:text-cyan-300
          backdrop-blur-xl"
          >
            <BadgeCheck size={18} />
            Week 1 Curriculum
          </span>

          <h1
            class="mt-8
          text-5xl/tight
          md:text-6xl/tight
          font-bold
          tracking-tight
          text-heading-1"
          >
            Microsoft 365
            <span
              class="text-transparent
            bg-clip-text
            bg-gradient-to-r
            from-indigo-600
            via-primary
            to-green-500"
            >
              Fundamentals
            </span>
          </h1>

          <Paragraph className="mt-8 text-lg">
            Week 1 introduces the core concepts of Microsoft 365 administration.
            Students will learn how Microsoft 365 environments work, how
            identities are managed, how licenses are assigned, and how
            administrators secure and monitor enterprise cloud environments.
          </Paragraph>

          <Pagebreadcrumb active="weekone" />
        </div>

        <!-- Topics -->
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-20">
          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Cloud size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>M365 Administration Foundations</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn what Microsoft 365 is, how organizations use
              it, and the responsibilities of a Microsoft 365 administrator.
              This includes understanding cloud services like Exchange Online,
              SharePoint, Teams, OneDrive, and Entra ID.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Microsoft 365 Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <ServerCog size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Tenant Setup & Configuration</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how Microsoft 365 tenants are created and configured.
              Students will understand domains, subscriptions, regions,
              organizational settings, and how businesses structure their cloud
              environments.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/admin/setup/setup"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Tenant Setup Guide
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Users size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>User & Identity Management</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how administrators create users, manage
              passwords, reset accounts, configure groups, and handle identities
              using Microsoft Entra ID. Identity management is one of the most
              important responsibilities in Microsoft 365 administration.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/fundamentals/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Entra ID Fundamentals
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-yellow-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <KeyRound size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Roles & Access Control</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how organizations control permissions in Microsoft 365.
              Students will understand administrator roles, role-based access
              control (RBAC), and why least-privilege access is important for
              security.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/role-based-access-control/overview"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              RBAC Overview
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <BadgeCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>License & Subscription Management</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will learn how Microsoft licenses work, how subscriptions
              are assigned to users, and how organizations manage Microsoft 365
              services and billing.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/commerce/licenses/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Licensing Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-orange-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <ShieldCheck size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Security & Compliance Fundamentals</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn the basics of Microsoft 365 security including multi-factor
              authentication, conditional access, data protection, compliance
              policies, and how organizations secure cloud identities and
              information.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/conditional-access/overview"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Security & Compliance Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-sky-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <BarChart3 size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Monitoring & Reporting</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will understand how administrators monitor Microsoft 365
              environments, generate usage reports, track user activities, and
              identify system or security issues using admin dashboards.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/enterprise/view-service-health?view=o365-worldwide"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Reporting Documentation
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-green-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Activity size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Service Health & Incident Management</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Learn how administrators track Microsoft service outages, monitor
              incidents, review advisories, and communicate service disruptions
              affecting users and organizations.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/admin/manage/view-service-health"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              Service Health Docs
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Card -->
          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 shadow-2xl"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div
                class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-700 to-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center"
              >
                <Terminal size={26} />
              </div>

              <Titlenew>Automation & PowerShell Basics</Titlenew>
            </div>

            <Paragraph className="mt-6">
              Students will be introduced to PowerShell and automation concepts.
              Learn how administrators use scripts and commands to automate
              repetitive tasks, manage users, and simplify Microsoft 365
              administration.
            </Paragraph>

            <a
              href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/powershell/"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:underline"
            >
              PowerShell Documentation
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <Selar />
        <div class="pt-10">
          <Requirement />
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
